- Bugfix: Ensure changing an entry's type works reliably when the biblatex source view is open. The problem was caused by the ordering in BibEntry.setType: the internal changed flag needs to be set before the type property's value is updated so listeners see a consistent state. The code now sets changed = true before calling this.type.setValue(...), keeping the FieldChangedEvent posting intact.
- Changelog: added an entry describing the fix (#5905).", "id": 44608778}}

